  "summary": "Write the room setpoint (AV-1), and the supply setpoint (AV-2) for supply or dual control. Read room and supply temperatures, heating demand and the stage statuses. With MSV-3 = ExtBMS a 2-10 V signal on AI-1 sets the heating demand directly.",
